# TLA+ Toolbox and TLC-generated state/trace artifacts
**/.toolbox/
**/states/
**/states-*/
**/MC*.tla
**/*_TTrace_*.tla
**/*.out

# Locally generated model-check reports; retain the versioned schema.
formal/results/*.json
!formal/results/schema.json
!formal/results/h1-full.result.json

# Retain the current Verus evidence and its versioned schema.
mechanized/results/*.json
!mechanized/results/verification-report.json
!mechanized/results/verification-report.schema.v1.json
!mechanized/results/verification-report-linux-*.json

# Standard Rust build output for the M4 reference broker.
**/target/

# Manuscript and local review material are separate from the artifact.
paper/
paper-ndss/
paper-evidence-current.md
fig*.png
dist/
tmp/

# Development notes retained only in local checkouts.
artifact/README.md
artifact/results/README.md
formal/README.md
formal/agentbound-motivating-example.md
formal/fse-2027-submission-contract.md
formal/related-work-audit.md
formal/results/README.md
formal/tooling.md
formal/value-refinement.md
mechanized/README.md
mechanized/results/README.md
reference-broker/evaluation/results/README.md

# Raw experiment runs stay private; curated evidence is under evaluation/evidence.
reference-broker/evaluation/results/redis-process-crash-runs/
reference-broker/evaluation/results/k4-i1-*.json

# Python validation-script caches.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Retain only the versioned Linux artifact preflight report.
artifact/results/*.json
!artifact/results/linux-smoke-preflight.json
!artifact/results/archive-smoke-preflight-*.json
!artifact/results/tla-*.json
